{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t港鐵表示，早前香港大學站附近的信號設備故障已修復，港島綫列車服務陸續恢復正常。<br/>\n<br/>\n較早前，來往堅尼地城站至柴灣站的整體行車時間一度需要額外 5至8分鐘。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T01:24:00.335444+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":82,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T00:53:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T03:06:10.247459+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T01:17:36.611034+00:00","content_hash":"1292246aba99dcceea7d20fc2805b1d26e4c20d51e53bf792a1b72f321c44332","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}